        "id": 1002124
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-05-25T16:21:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why are we only passing low? I actually don\u0027t understand the actual problem these passthrough_* are trying to accomplish. If we need to go to this much trouble then we should just add a callback into the board again.",
      "revId": "c5b2c74e6ae37432fc14d48d08840a0ded2814fd",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
